[I] Command-line tool for managing Amazon S3 and CloudFront services

[T] S3cmd is a Python command line tool for uploading, retrieving and
[T] managing data in Amazon S3 and other S3 compatible cloud storage, as
[T] well as CloudFront. It supports bucket management, sync of directories,
[T] encryption and more.

[U] https://github.com/s3tools/s3cmd

